 full concrete construction in a wonderful building. The galley kitchen opens to the spacious dining and living rooms, where you’ll also find a built-in air conditioning unit on the south wall. From large closets to a spacious laundry room with cupboards, plus a storage room connected to the balcony, there is no shortage of storage capacity here. The building’s common area has a games room with kitchenette and a half bath, plus this suite comes with an assigned indoor heated parking space AND an outdoor stall! The $484 condo fee includes heat, water, TV connection, and it all adds up to adult living perfectly situated near all sorts of shopping, services, and amenities in Spruce Grove's vibrant core. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$219,000"],["Type","Apartment"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,020 sq ft"],["Year built","1994"],["Condo fee","$484 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","City Centre"],["Town","Spruce Grove"],["Postal code","T7X3X1"],["MLS® number","E4516496"],["Listed","November 13, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Stove, Dryer, Hood Fan, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Hot water radiator heat, Baseboard heaters"],["Parking","Underground, Parkade, Heated Garage"],["Condo fee includes","Common Area Maintenance, Exterior Maintenance, Cable TV, Heat, Water, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.00 m × 5.10 m (16'5\" × 16'9\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.30 m × 2.90 m (10'10\" × 9'6\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","2.80 m × 2.60 m (9'2\" × 8'6\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","6.40 m × 3.10 m (21'0\" × 10'2\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.50 m × 4.10 m (11'6\" × 13'5\")"],["Laundry room","Main level","1.80 m × 1.90 m (5'11\" × 6'3\")"]],"courtesy":"Arlie Jespersen, Century 21 Leading","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"spruce-grove","hood_slug":"city-centre","area":""}